{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"8a6b1f392138c945","__entryId":"easing","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">B</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"font-style:italic\">I</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">🔗</span>\n          <span style=\"width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--border)\"></span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">发布</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out：变色先快后慢，手指能感到“跟手”\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.9);width:220px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:220px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">新版本 v2.4 已就绪</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:9px\">重启应用即可完成更新。</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-text\">稍后</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即更新</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out 入场：快速冲进来，到点前“刹车”停稳\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:100px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:76%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:8px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;opacity:.25;transform:translateY(-6px)\">✓ 保存成功</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:34px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">✓ 保存成功</div>\n        <span style=\"position:absolute;top:16px;right:112px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">↑</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C22,25 30,22 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-in 退场：起步较缓，随后加速离开\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:330px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">设计规范 · 动效 Tokens</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n        <code style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">--ease-standard</code>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 24\" style=\"width:36px;height:22px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,21 C13,4 20,3 37,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">按钮悬停</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">弹窗入场</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">卡片浮起</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">全用这一条</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">B</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"font-style:italic\">I</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">🔗</span>\n          <span style=\"width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--border)\"></span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">Publish</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out: The color changes first quickly and then slowly, and the fingers can feel \"following the hand\"\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.9);width:220px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:220px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">New version v2.4 is ready</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:9px\">Restart the application to complete the update. </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-text\">Later</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Update now</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out entry: rush in quickly and \"brake\" to a stop before reaching the point\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:100px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:76%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:8px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;opacity:.25;transform:translateY(-6px)\">✓ Saved</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:34px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">✓ Saved</div>\n        <span style=\"position:absolute;top:16px;right:112px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">↑</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C22,25 30,22 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-in: start slowly, then accelerate away\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:330px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Design specifications · Animation Tokens</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n        <code style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">--ease-standard</code>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 24\" style=\"width:36px;height:22px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,21 C13,4 20,3 37,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Button hover</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Pop-up admission</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Card floats</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Use this one all</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"easing-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"curve\"><svg class=\"easing-anat-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 72\"><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"64\" class=\"easing-anat-axis\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"64\" class=\"easing-anat-axis\"/><path d=\"M6,64 C34,10 56,6 96,6\" class=\"easing-anat-path\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"time\"><span class=\"easing-anat-axislabel\">横轴：时间 →</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"progress\"><span class=\"easing-anat-axislabel\">纵轴：进度 ↑</span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"easing-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"curve\"><svg class=\"easing-anat-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 72\"><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"64\" class=\"easing-anat-axis\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"64\" class=\"easing-anat-axis\"/><path d=\"M6,64 C34,10 56,6 96,6\" class=\"easing-anat-path\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"time\"><span class=\"easing-anat-axislabel\">Horizontal axis: time →</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"progress\"><span class=\"easing-anat-axislabel\">Vertical axis: progress ↑</span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"curve","cn":"曲线形状","en":"Curve","desc":"弯在哪里，快慢就在哪里","desc_en":"The curve maps time to progress. Its slope is the animation’s instantaneous speed: a steeper slope moves faster, while a flatter slope moves slower."},{"key":"time","cn":"时间轴","en":"Time","desc":"横轴，动画从头播到尾","desc_en":"The horizontal axis represents time from the start to the end of the animation"},{"key":"progress","cn":"进度轴","en":"Progress","desc":"纵轴，属性变到了多少","desc_en":"The vertical axis represents the fraction of the property change that has completed"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"先快后慢","en":"ease-out","demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,47 C18,8 30,5 57,5\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,47 C18,8 30,5 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"入场与出现，先快后稳停住","when_en":"Entering and appearing, first quickly and then steadily."},{"cn":"先慢后快","en":"ease-in","demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C30,45 42,42 57,5\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C30,45 42,42 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"退场与消失，加速离场","when_en":"Exit and disappear, speed up and leave"},{"cn":"两头都缓","en":"ease-in-out","demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C24,45 36,5 57,5\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C24,45 36,5 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"原地状态切换，两端都柔和","when_en":"Switch to the original state, both ends are soft"},{"cn":"自定义曲线","en":"cubic-bezier","demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C28,2 44,14 57,8\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C28,2 44,14 57,8\"/></svg>","when":"要独特品牌手感时微调","when_en":"Fine-tuning for a unique brand feel"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>入场可尝试 ease-out</b>：{c:modal}、{c:toast} 常会显得快进慢停；仍要按距离和语义测试","m":"easing-out"},{"t":"<b>退场可尝试 ease-in</b>：元素加速离开；不是所有切换都适用","m":"easing-in"},{"t":"<b>cubic-bezier 自定义</b>：用四个参数调整曲线，并收敛为可复用的动效变量","m":"easing-bezier"},{"t":"<b>定成少量动效变量</b>：按反馈、进入、离开等用途复用，统一但不强迫所有动作一条曲线","m":"easing-token"}],"dont":[{"t":"位移入场直接使用 <b>linear</b>：它更适合进度和连续旋转，应按语义选择曲线","m":"easing-linear","bad":true},{"t":"把 <b>ease-in</b> 当入场硬规则：有时会显得起步迟缓，应按目标与距离测试","m":"easing-wrong","bad":true},{"t":"每个动画<b>随意定义不同曲线</b>：会削弱动效系统的一致性","m":"easing-mess","bad":true},{"t":"用过度拉伸的贝塞尔曲线<b>模拟回弹</b>：难以稳定控制；需要物理回弹时可用 {c:spring}","m":"easing-overshoot","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"弹窗进入时需要快速响应再平稳停下，退出时不应拖延当前操作。怎样设置速度变化更合理？","options":[{"id":"semantic-easing-system","label":"进入先尝试快进慢停，退出尝试加速离开，并按距离测试后收敛为变量","feedback":"进入、退出的任务方向不同，按语义测试并复用曲线能兼顾响应感与一致性。","correct":true},{"id":"linear-for-everything","label":"所有进入、退出和持续动画都用 linear，保证每一帧移动相同距离","feedback":"匀速适合持续旋转或进度，对界面位移常显得机械，也没有区分进入和离开。","correct":false},{"id":"random-custom-curves","label":"每个弹窗单独拖一条不同曲线，只按当前画面感觉决定","feedback":"局部可能顺眼，但随意曲线会让同类交互产生不同节奏，难以维护和预测。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A modal should respond quickly and settle smoothly on entry, while exit should not delay the current task. How should its speed change?","options":[{"id":"semantic-easing-system","label":"Start entry fast and settle, accelerate exit, test against distance, and consolidate curves into tokens","feedback":"Entry and exit serve different directions, so semantic testing plus reuse balances responsiveness and consistency.","correct":true},{"id":"linear-for-everything","label":"Use linear for entry, exit, and continuous animation so every frame moves the same distance","feedback":"Constant speed fits rotation or progress but often feels mechanical for interface movement and ignores direction.","correct":false},{"id":"random-custom-curves","label":"Draw a different custom curve for every modal based only on how the current screen feels","feedback":"Each may look acceptable alone, but arbitrary curves give peer interactions inconsistent and unpredictable rhythm.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请为弹窗进入和退出分别选择符合任务的缓动：进入快速响应后平稳停下，退出更利落。结合移动距离测试，不套固定结论；最终收敛成少量 motion token，并检查减少动态效果设置。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Choose task-appropriate easing for modal entry and exit: respond quickly and settle on entry, leave more decisively on exit. Test with actual travel distance, consolidate into a small motion-token set, and respect reduced motion."}},"references":[{"title":"缓动函数","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function","title_en":"<easing-function>"}],"scenes":["按钮悬停的手感","弹窗入场刹车","元素退场加速","全站统一动效曲线"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Make entering motion settle naturally","m":"easing-out"},{"t":"Let an exiting element accelerate away","m":"easing-in"},{"t":"Give repeated interactions a consistent rhythm","m":"easing-bezier"},{"t":"Tune a transition without changing its path","m":"easing-token"}],"dont":[{"t":"Choose a curve only because its name sounds right","m":"easing-linear","bad":true},{"t":"Use dramatic bounce for routine controls","m":"easing-wrong","bad":true},{"t":"Mix many easing curves in one flow","m":"easing-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Make the beginning so slow that input feels delayed","m":"easing-overshoot","bad":true}],"scenes":["Panel opening","Menu closing","Card movement","Page transition"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">B</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"font-style:italic\">I</span>\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\">🔗</span>\n          <span style=\"width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--border)\"></span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">Publish</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out: The color changes first quickly and then slowly, and the fingers can feel \"following the hand\"\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.9);width:220px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:220px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">New version v2.4 is ready</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:9px\">Restart the application to complete the update. </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-text\">Later</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Update now</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C14,4 22,3 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-out entry: rush in quickly and \"brake\" to a stop before reaching the point\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:100px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:76%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:8px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;opacity:.25;transform:translateY(-6px)\">✓ Saved</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:34px;right:12px;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">✓ Saved</div>\n        <span style=\"position:absolute;top:16px;right:112px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">↑</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 44 28\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,25 C22,25 30,22 41,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        ease-in: start slowly, then accelerate away\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:330px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Design specifications · Animation Tokens</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n        <code style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">--ease-standard</code>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 24\" style=\"width:36px;height:22px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,21 C13,4 20,3 37,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Button hover</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Pop-up admission</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Card floats</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Use this one all</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,47 C18,8 30,5 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"Entering and appearing, first quickly and then steadily."},{"demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C30,45 42,42 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"Exit and disappear, speed up and leave"},{"demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C24,45 36,5 57,5\"/></svg>","when":"Switch to the original state, both ends are soft"},{"demo":"<svg class=\"easing-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 50\"><path d=\"M3,45 C28,2 44,14 57,8\"/></svg>","when":"Fine-tuning for a unique brand feel"}]},"usageMocks":{"easing-out":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,46 C24,10 40,6 76,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:110px\">ease-out：先快后慢，逐渐减速并停下</span></div>","easing-in":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,44 C40,44 56,40 76,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f7ba1e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:110px\">ease-in：起步缓，加速离开</span></div>","easing-bezier":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,44 C22,2 46,40 76,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"2\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"var(--text-3)\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"var(--text-3)\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:110px\">cubic-bezier 四个数，捏出任意曲线</span></div>","easing-token":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">--ease</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">按钮</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">卡片</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">弹窗</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">按动作类型复用少量曲线，兼顾一致性与场景差异</span></div>","easing-linear":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,46 L76,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:110px\">linear 保持匀速，不适合所有入场位移</span></div>","easing-wrong":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,44 C40,44 56,40 76,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:110px\">入场使用 ease-in，前段反馈可能显得迟缓</span></div>","easing-mess":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 40\" style=\"width:60px;height:40px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,37 L57,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 40\" style=\"width:60px;height:40px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,37 C18,6 30,4 57,4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 40\" style=\"width:60px;height:40px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M3,34 C30,34 40,30 57,4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">每个动画随意定义曲线，会削弱系统一致性</span>","easing-overshoot":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 50\" style=\"width:80px;height:50px;flex:none\"><path d=\"M4,42 C30,-8 52,26 76,12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:110px\">两端拉过头，回弹失控；要弹性该用弹簧</span></div>"}}}